OL,3,GNEWSATree flinging contest a
OL,4,A"much-loved" festive event
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarm owner Clive Collins said: "The
OL,7,Ftree fling has become a much-loved part
OL,8,Fof our Christmas build-up, and people
OL,9,Freally do take the competition
OL,10,Fseriously."
